<title>HONG KONG: YGM Trading interim profit rises 14 pct.</title>
<headline>YGM Trading interim profit rises 14 pct.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1996-12-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months ended September 30</p>
<p>(in million HK$ unless stated)</p>
<p>    Shr (H.K. cents)	   38.4     vs  35.7</p>
<p>    Dividend (H.K. cents)    11.0     vs  10.0</p>
<p>    Exceptional items	  nil	vs  nil</p>
<p>    Net			    57.49    vs  50.39</p>
<p>    Turnover		     1,071.20 vs  1,054.90</p>
<p>    Company name		 YGM Trading Ltd</p>
<p>    Books close		  January 20-24</p>
<p>    Dividend payable	   January 28</p>
<p>NOTE - YGM is a garment making, property investment and development firm.</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2843 6370</p>
